[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2752842\">4450D70</a></p><p>1. Undo the fixing pins.</p><p>2. Remove the rear brake drum.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046801.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<p>1. Undo the rear wheel hub nut.</p><p>2. Remove the rear wheel hub (2a) complete with spacers (2b).</p><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/769.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2000041.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th colspan=\"1\"><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>The rear hub bearing should not\nbe dismantled from the hub. If it proves necessary on account of noise\nor excessive clearance, replace the rear hub complete with bearing.</p></aside></th></tr><tr><td></td><td colspan=\"1\"></td></tr></table></div></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046802.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the rear wheel hub complete\nwith spacers.</p><p>Tighten the rear wheel hub nut to torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Nut</p></td><td><p>REAR WHEEL HUB WITH BEARINGS</p></td><td><p>M22 x 1.5</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>28</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Fit the rear brake drum and tighten the\nretaining pins.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>REAR BRAKE DRUM</p></td><td><p>M12</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.2</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2752842\">4450D70</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]